Modifications (Arif Pdf Editör, 2026)

Arif Pdf Editör is a modified version of PdfCraft 0.9.0 (https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft,
tag v0.9.0, commit 645016addcfb9078c557f0189559ab47cdcee057), changed in 2026 by Gümüşhane Valiliği
Bilgi İşlem Şube Müdürlüğü (Arif DUMAN): the name, window title, app icon and version resource were
changed; the ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos, the community/Discord/web links and the GitHub update
check were removed; settings use the ArifPdfEditor folder. The full change set is arifpdf.patch.
0.9.0-arif.2: on Windows the Print dialog lists the spooler's printers at once (queue names first,
two-sided support filled in when each driver's capabilities have been read).
It remains licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

0.9.0-arif.3: the print preview is drawn in colour again (its raster tag shared a bit with the
"print in greyscale" marker, so every preview was turned grey) and at least two device pixels per
point, so it is sharp on 100% displays. When a Windows driver refuses the Direct2D/XPS print path
before accepting any sheet (seen as "Render error ... 0x80040003" with a Brother MFC-L8690CDW),
the job is printed through GDI instead (crates/ui-egui/src/gdi_print.rs), using the driver's own
settings for copies, collation, two-sided, colour and orientation.

0.9.0-arif.4: the Print dialog has thin dividers between its rows and groups; hovering the preview opens a
3x magnifier (a separate high-resolution raster, rendered on first hover); the preview shows an A4 sheet
(the dialog's default paper) at reduced scale with a soft shadow, other papers in proportion to it, and
is rendered at twice the screen's pixel density on the device pixel grid so text stays sharp.

0.9.0-arif.5: the Print dialog is wide (settings on the left, a larger preview on the right, sized to the window) and the
hover magnifier of arif.4 is removed; the home page's Privacy note describes this build (Gümüşhane Valiliği Bilgi İşlem
Şube Müdürlüğü); the program checks the institution's own update server (ArifPdfEditor.json: 10.129.0.29, then
burasigumushane.com, then 192.168.2.200) and offers "Yeni sürüm var — Güncelle"; the update is installed by the package's own
Kur.ps1 -Guncelle once the program is closed, with Preferences ▸ "Otomatik güncelle (sessiz)". No upstream update endpoint is contacted.

0.9.0-arif.6: Edit a PDF - a paragraph open for typing is always applied (never dropped) when another tool,
selection or paragraph takes over, and an edit whose text cannot be read back with the paragraph's font is
refused (the original text is kept) instead of making the paragraph disappear; Delete/Backspace removes the
selected objects, including the PDF's own paragraphs and pictures (one undoable step), and Delete on a
paragraph whose whole text is selected removes the paragraph's box; the in-app updater runs Kur.ps1 from a
plain .ps1 file in a minimised window (no -EncodedCommand, no hidden window).
